   Innovat Engn, Lab Appl Mech, Sect Mechatron; Ionian Univ, Dept Hist,
   M.Sc Hist Res, Teaching \& New Technologies; Reg Ionian Isl},
Abstract = {While frailty and other multi-scale factors have to be correlated during
   a geriatric assessment, few prototype robots have already been developed
   in order to measure and provide real-time information, concerning
   elderly daily activities. Cognitive impairment and alterations on daily
   functions should be immediate recognized from caregivers, in order to be
   prevented and probably treated. In this chapter we recognize the
   necessity of artificial robots during the personal service of the
   elderly population, not only as a mobile laboratory-geriatrician, but
   mainly as a socialized digital humanoid able to develop social behavior
   and activate memories and emotions.},
