Abstract = {The aim of this research is to emphasize the correspondence between
   psychological perception functions and dysfunctions in high performance
   sport 40 athletes in track and field. We used a questionnaire as an
   assessment instrument, and as methods. The results have shown the
   difference existing in the perception of coaches and athletes of 4
   psychic functions and 4 psychic dysfunctions. The psychic functions we
   chose are cognitive, psychological, educational and socio-emotional
