   Management; German Acad Exchange Serv Fdn; German Ind \& Commerce; Off
   European Commiss Hong Kong \& Macao; CSR Asia},
Abstract = {The consumer waste compressor is an equipment to) treat municipal waste.
   Being set in waste transfer stations, the function for the equipment is
   to pour the collected wastes into the collection-box of the compressor,
   and then squeezes the wastes into high-density blocks through constantly
   squeezing and dumping. The blocks are then pushed from compressor box
   into transport trucks by handspike devices, before they are transported
   to waste treatment factories for final treatment. In this paper, the
   framework and working principles of consumer waste compressors are
   introduced. In addition, its advantages and impacts on living
   environment are set forth.},
