Organization = {Yantai Univ; China Coal Res Inst, China Coal Technol Engn Grp; Natl Engn
   Lab Deep Shaft Construct Technol},
Abstract = {With the urban development,the number of private cars has been
   increasing and the construction scale of the basements in the
   residential district is becoming larger and larger. In order to meet the
   requirements of the structural stability of the buildings, the
   requirements for the technologies of the supports for slopes and deep
   foundation pits are getting higher and higher in engineering. In this
   paper, a certain residential community project is involved. The site is
   adjacent to the existing municipal road to the east, the north of the
   site is a road which has been planned, and the west of the site is the
   phase II project, the topographic conditions are complex. The
   construction scheme of the deep foundation pit works is analyzed, and
   the construction technologies of the soil nailing wall support, the
   enclosure row pile support, the large diameter long pile and pile wall
   works are introduced. It puts forward the corresponding quality control
   points, and provides reference and information for the treatment of
   foundation pit support under similar environmental conditions.},
