Abstract = {To study development of low-carbon city has significant meaning for
   transformation of city in China. This paper takes the DPSIR model as the
   basis to construct a low-carbon city evaluation index system in
   Beijing-tianjin-hebei region. By constructing the compound fuzzy
   matter-element, using the entropy weight method and formula of Euclid
   approach degree, calculates the closeness of low-carbon city from 2007
   to 2011 in Beijing-tianjin-hebei region. The results showed that
   low-carbon city development in Beijing is better than it in Tianjin and
   Hebei, however, considering the component, some questions remain, city
   pressure and urban pollution in Beijing area are higher than its in
