   designed with magnetic flocculation technology and principle of magnetic
   field generation. Five pairs of circular magnetic coils were used to
   constitute a large measuring range magnetic field generator by utilizing
   Helmholtz, and the reactor could be adjusted continuously from 1nT-1000
