Abstract = {This article mainly put forward a set of reasonable and feasible design
   method to the problems that exist in today's Bionic design of product
   according to the principle of the visual perception to make the bionic
   design more convenient and reliable. We simplify the Biological form
   according to the visual perception of the human and abstract the main
   structure features of the Biological form then convey the features
   property of the Biological form effectively through the simplified
   structure pattern, which makes it more suitable for the features of the
   modem product. The design method mentioned here improve the feasibility
   and reliability of the Bionic design and also provide a new idea to the
   designer who are carrying out the Bionic design.},
