   ``Tableland{''} villages own large amount of agricultural population.
   Using the analysis of ecological carrying capacity into the villages'
   settlement planning within small areas, this paper research on the
   relationship among maximum ecological carrying capacity, the current
   ecological carrying capacity and the current supporting population.
   Through the analysis of this relationship, to make the decision which
   villages owns the ability to accept more immigrations and which villages
   need to be integrated into other villages, at the same time, the
   villages were graded. Among the six grades of ecological carrying
   capacity villages, type. village is suitable to be extension, and type.
